## 9. UNREAL ENGINE 5 STANDARD APPROACH

### Graphics Quality (UE5 Native)

**`UGameUserSettings`** provides:
```cpp
GetOverallScalabilityLevel()       // 0=Low, 1=Medium, 2=High, 3=Epic, -1=Custom
SetOverallScalabilityLevel(int32)  // Set overall scalability
SetResolutionScaleValueEx()        // Resolution scale (0.5-2.0)
SetViewDistanceQuality()           // Distance, Shadows, Textures, etc.
ApplySettings(bool bCheckForCommandLineOverrides)
```

**Set individual quality settings:**
```cpp
UserSettings->SetResolutionScaleValueEx(1.0f);  // 100%
UserSettings->SetViewDistanceQuality(3);         // Epic
UserSettings->SetAntiAliasingQuality(3);
UserSettings->SetShadowQuality(3);
UserSettings->SetTextureQuality(3);
UserSettings->SetEffectsQuality(3);
UserSettings->SetPostProcessingQuality(3);
UserSettings->ApplySettings(false);
```

### Audio Volume (UE5 Native)

**Recommended approach:**

```cpp
// Set SoundClass volume directly
if (USoundClass* SoundClass = FindObject<USoundClass>(nullptr, TEXT("/Game/Audio/SoundClasses/SC_Master")))
{
    FAudioDevice* AudioDevice = GetWorld()->GetAudioDevice();
    if (AudioDevice)
    {
        AudioDevice->SetSoundMixClassOverride(SoundMix, SoundClass, Volume, Priority);
    }
}

// Or simpler approach - use SlateSound class:
if (UWorld* World = GetWorld())
{
    if (FAudioDevice* AudioDevice = World->GetAudioDevice())
    {
        // Set master volume (0.0 - 1.0)
        AudioDevice->GetMasterVolume() = 0.8f;
    }
}
```

**Better approach using SoundMix:**

```cpp
USoundMix* ActiveMix = nullptr;
if (USoundMix* MyMix = LoadObject<USoundMix>(nullptr, TEXT("/Game/Audio/SoundMixes/SM_GameplayMix")))
{
    if (FAudioDevice* AudioDevice = GetWorld()->GetAudioDevice())
    {
        // Set individual sound class volume
        AudioDevice->SetSoundMixClassOverride(
            MyMix,
            LoadObject<USoundClass>(nullptr, TEXT("/Game/Audio/SoundClasses/SC_Master")),
            0.8f,  // Volume (0.0-1.0)
            1.0f   // Fade time (seconds)
        );
        ActiveMix = MyMix;
    }
}
```

