## 12. KEY DESIGN DECISIONS FOR YOUR PROJECT

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| **ShowPopup/ClosePopup pattern** | Consistent with existing UI (CreateRoomWindow, CosmeticMainWindow) |
| **Z-Order 100** | Same as other popups; allows modal-like experience |
| **Input Mode UIOnly** | Prevents accidental gameplay while settings open |
| **GGameUserSettingsIni for persistence** | Matches currency/cosmetic patterns in codebase |
| **GameInstanceSubsystem** | Globally accessible, survives level transitions |
| **FInputModeUIOnly** | Standard UE5 pattern for modal UI (see CreateRoomWindow) |
